    "ls|LS17_S7_U_384": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \n MINISTRY OF INFORMATION & BROADCASTING \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION No. 384 \n(TO BE ANSWERED ON 30.11.2021) \nSETTING UP OF FM TRANSMITTERS IN SSB \n384.  DR. SANJAY JAISWAL: \nWill the Minister of INFORMATION AND BROADCASTING be pleased \nto state:  \n(a)  whether the Government has initiated the setting  up of approved \nFrequency Modulation (FM) transmitters in Sashastra Seema Bal \n(SSB) premises at seven locations along the Indo -Nepal Bo rder \nincluding West Champaran in the State of Bihar; \n(b)  if so, the details thereof;  \n(c)  the details and the total quantum of funds sanctioned by the \nGovernment for the same; and  \n(d)  the time by which the setting up of the FM transmitters will be \ncompleted? \n \n \n \n\n \nANSWER \nTHE MINISTER OF INFORMATION AND BROADCASTING; AND \nMINISTER OF YOUTH AFFAIRS AND SPORTS  \n(SHRI ANURAG SINGH THAKUR) \n(a) to (d) : Yes, Sir. Schemes for setting up of Frequency Modulation \n(FM) transmitters in Sashastra Seema Bal  (SSB) premises at Seven \nlocations along the Indo-Nepal Border have been approved including \nSSB Premise s at Narkatiaganj in West Champaran District in the \nState of Bihar.  Details of the transmitters are given in Annexure. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \nAnnexure \n \nANNEXURE AS REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (a) to (d) OF LOK \nSABHA UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 384 FOR ANSWER ON \n30.11.2021 \n \nDetails of SSB Locations for setting up of FM transmitters \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nSl. No. Location of \nSSB \nPremises \nDistrict State Power Fund \nallocation    \n(Rs. in \ncrore) \n1. Bathnaha Araria Bihar 10 kW 6.67 \n2. Narkatiaganj West \nChamparan \nBihar 10 kW 6.67 \n3. Gadaniya Lakheempur Uttar \nPradesh \n10 kW 6.67 \n4. Nanpara Bahraich Uttar \nPradesh \n10 kW 6.67 \n5. Sitamarhi Sitamarhi Bihar 10 kW 6.67 \n6. Maharajganj Maharajganj Uttar \nPradesh \n10 kW 6.67 \n7. Champawat Champawat Uttrakhand 1 kW 5.45 ",
