    "ls|LS17_S7_U_412": "  \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT \nDEPARTMENT OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 412 \n  ANSWERED ON 30/11/2021 \n \n FUNDS AND EMPLOYMENT UNDER MGNREGS \n \n412.  MS. MIMI CHAKRABORTY: \nSHRI MANNE SRINIVAS REDDY: \n \nWill the Minister of RURAL DEVELOPMENT be pleased to state: \n \n(a)  the details of the funds released and utilized  under the Mahatma Gandhi National \nRural Employment Guarantee Scheme (MGNREGS) Projects during each of  the last \nthree years and the current year, State/U T-wise and on going projects till October, \n2021; \n(b)  the number of rural areas covered and employment provided under this scheme during \nthe said period, State-wise; and \n(c)  whether the Government is contempleting to provide  more funds to States who have \nover-spent/utilised all the funds on MGNREGS and if so, the details thereof? \n \nANSWER \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT  \n(SADHVI NIRANJAN JYOTI) \n \n \n(a) &  (c): Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Scheme (Mahatma \nGandhi NREGS) is a demand driven wage employment programme and funds are released to \nthe States/UTs on the basis of \"agreed to\" Labour Budget (LB) and performance of the \nStates/UTs during the financial year. Fund release to States/UTs is a continuous process and \nCentral Government is committed in making funds available keeping in view the demand for \nwork. The Ministry seeks additional funds as and when required for meeting the demand f or \nwork on the ground. Ministry of Finance allocated additional funds of the Rs. 10,000 crore \nfor Mahatma Gandhi NREGS as an interim measure. Further, allocation may be made upon \nassessment of demand during the Revised Estimate (RE) stage.  \n  \nState/UT-wise details of funds sanctioned/released for wage, material & \nadministrative component under Mahatma Gandhi NREGS in last three financial years (FY) \nand current FY 2021-22 (as on 24.11.2021) is given at Annexure-I.  \n  \nState/UT-wise number of ongoing works und er Mahatma Gandhi NREGS in current \nFY 2021-22 (as on 31.10.2021) is given at Annexure-II.   \n  \n(b):       State/UT-wise number of rural areas (Gram Panchayats) covered and employment \nprovide (persondays generated) under Mahatma Gandhi NREGS during the last three \nfinancial years and current FY 2020-21 (as on 31.10.2021) is given at Annexure-III. \n\n  \nAnnexure-I referred in reply to parts (a) & (c) of Lok Sabha Unstarred Question \nNo.412 dated 30.11.2021. \n(Rs. in crore) \nState/UT-wise details of funds sanctioned/released for wage, material & administrative \ncomponent under Mahatma Gandhi NREGS in last three FYs and current FY 2021-22 \nS \nNo. State/UT FY 2018-\n19 \nFY 2019-\n20 \n FY  \n2020-21 \n FY 2021-22  \n(as on 24.11.2021) \n1 2  4 5 6 7 \n1 \nANDAMAN AND \nNICOBAR 7.62 5.84 4.86 7.63 \n2 ANDHRA PRADESH 6684.54 7311.48 10365.48 6271.76 \n3 ARUNACHAL PRADESH 163.25 107.57 348.95 262.82 \n4 ASSAM 1050.37 1476.24 2514.55 1372.13 \n5 BIHAR 2891.94 3283.88 6647.01 3942.28 \n6 CHHATTISGARH 3082.94 2792.41 4144.19 2296.12 \n7 GOA 0.49 2.17 0.91 0.00 \n8 GUJARAT 1060.80 775.84 1513.75 1253.92 \n9 HARYANA 356.25 345.27 776.67 486.46 \n10 HIMACHAL PRADESH 778.74 615.37 963.69 467.42 \n11 JAMMU AND KASHMIR 620.36 825.62 1166.63 360.19 \n12 JHARKHAND 1538.06 1311.15 3489.84 2073.51 \n13 KARNATAKA 3040.25 5546.20 5605.01 4263.73 \n14 KERALA 2354.74 3541.12 4300.32 2040.79 \n15 LADAKH 0.00 0.00 22.49 29.57 \n16 LAKSHADWEEP 0.16 0.24 0.00 0.00 \n17 MADHYA PRADESH 4681.41 4825.63 9225.40 5557.95 \n18 MAHARASHTRA 2014.64 1723.25 1639.78 1109.54 \n19 MANIPUR 269.60 610.75 737.57 333.09 \n20 MEGHALAYA 786.14 1026.64 1286.41 574.24 \n21 MIZORAM 392.37 526.74 576.81 358.83 \n22 NAGALAND 138.86 298.54 483.82 317.81 \n23 ODISHA 2218.21 2488.22 5409.50 4154.94 \n24 PUDUCHERRY 14.75 17.04 27.13 10.63 \n25 PUNJAB 598.55 776.89 1287.86 797.96 \n26 RAJASTHAN 5492.31 6891.74 9129.03 6829.77 \n27