    "ls|LS17_S7_U_442": "O.I.H.  \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT \nDEPARTMENT OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT \nLOK  SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 442 \n  ANSWERED ON 30/11/2021 \n \nROAD CONNECTIVITY PROJECT FOR LEFT WING EXTREMISM  \nAFFECTED AREA \n \n442.  SHRI ARUN SAO: \nSHRI VIJAY BAGHEL: \n \nWill the Minister of RURAL DEVELOPMENT be pleased to state: \n \n(a)  the details of the funds allocated for the selected  States under Road Connectivity \nProject for Left Wing Extremism Affected Areas (RCPLWEA) since the launch of the \nabove scheme along with the State-wise and yearwise details thereof; \n(b)  the details of the roads and the names of the  places which are to be connected under \nthis scheme in the state of Chhattisgarh; \n(c)  the details of the work that has been completed  under the said scheme particularly in \nthe state of Chhattisgarh along with the details of pending work; and \n(d)  the reasons of pendency along with the details thereof? \n \n \nANSWER \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT  \n(SADHVI NIRANJAN JYOTI) \n \n \n(a)     The details of Central share of funds released and total expenditure (including State \nShare) for the selected States under Road Connectivity Project for Left Wing Extremism \nAffected Areas (RCPLWEA) since the launch of the scheme is given at Annexure-I. \n(b) to (c) Details of roads sanctioned, constructed and balance in various states and that in \nChhattisgarh (district wise) is given at Annexure II. Further, the details of the roads and the \nnames of the places which are to be connected under this sche me is in public domain at \nomms.nic.in. It can be viewed through weblink: omms.nic.in ->proposals->State wise list of \nroads. \n(d)     Reasons for pendency of works under RCPLWEA are delay due to Left Wing \nExtremism activities, lack of response to tenders by c ontractors, difficult working conditions, \nforest clearance issues, etc. \n \n***** \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nAnn